{
  "title": "Ziyarat on Saturday",
  "data": "On Saturday, recite this ziyarat of the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.):\nاَشْهَدُ اَنْ لَا اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللهُ وَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ \nASH-HADO AN LAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO WAHDAHU LAA SHAREEKA LAHU \nI testify that there is no god save Allah; He is One; there is no associate (partner) with Him. \nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ رَسُوْلُهٗ وَاَنَّكَ مُحَمَّدُ بْنُ عَبْدِ اللهِ \nWA ASH-HADO ANNAKA RASOOLOHU WA ANNAKA MOHAMMADUBNO A’BDIL LAAHE \nI testify that you are His Apostle, and you are Mohammad son of Abdullah; \nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ قَدْ بَلَّغْتَ رِسَالَاتِ رَبِّكَ وَنَصَحْتَ لِاُمَّتِكَ \nWA ASH-HADO ANNAKA QAD BALLAGHTA RESAALAATE RABBEKA WA NASAHTA LEUMMATEKA \nand I testify that you had delivered the Message of your Lord, advised and warned your followers (Ummah) like a sincere friend, \nوَجَاهَدْتَ فِیْ سَبِيْلِ اللهِ بِالْحِكْمَةِ وَالْمَوْعِظَةِ الْحَسَنَةِ \nWA JAAHADTA FEE SABEELIL LAAHE BILHIKMATE WAL MAWE’ZATIL HASANATE \nand strived in the way of Allah with wisdom and goodly exhortation,\nوَاَدَّيْتَ الَّذِیْ عَلَيْكَ مِنَ الْحَقِّ \nWA ADDAYTAL LAZEE A’LAYKA MENAL HAQQE \nand fulfilled the duty of truth that was upon you;\nوَاَنَّكَ قَدْ رَؤُٔفْتَ بِالْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَغَلَظْتَ عَلَی الْكَافِرِيْنَ \nWA ANNAKA QAD RAOOFTA BILMOMENEENA WA GHALAZTA A’LAL KAAFEREEN \n(and) you had been kind and compassionate to the believers, (but) was harsh with the disbelievers, \nوَعَبَدْتَ اللهَ مُخْلِصًا حَتّٰی اَتٰيكَ الْيَقِيْنُ \nWA A’BADTAL LAAHA MUKHLESAN HATTAA ATAAKAL YAQEENO \nand had sincerely served Allah, till the inevitable (what was certain) came unto you. \nفَبَلَغَ اللهُ بِكَ اَشْرَفِ مَحَلِّ الْمُكَرَّمِيْنَ \nFABALAGHAL LAAHO BEKA ASHRAFA MAHALLIL MOKARRAMEENA \nSo Allah made you reach the highest stage of glory and honour. \nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِیْ اسْتَنْقَذَنَا بِكَ مِنَ الشِّرْكِ وَالضَّلَالَةِ \nALHAMDOLIL LAAHIL LAZEES TANQAZANAA BEKA MENASH SHIRKE WAZ ZALAALATE \n(All) praise is for Allah (only) who saved us through you from the polytheism and going astray.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِهٖ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALEHI\nO Allah! Send blessings on Mohammad and on his children. \nوَاجْعَلْ صَلَوَاتِكَ وَصَلَوَاتِ مَلَآئِكَتِكَ \nWAJ A’L SALAWAATEKA WA SALAWAATE MALAAEKATEKA \nYour blessings, and invocations of Your Angels, \nوَاَنْبِيَائِكَ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ وَعِبَادِكَ الصَّالِحِيْنَ \nWA AMBEYAAEKA WALMURSALEEN WA E’BAADEKAS SAALEHEENA \n(of) Your Prophets and Apostles, (of) Your pious servants, \nوَاَهْلِ السَّمَوَاتِ وَالْاَرَضِيْنَ \nWA AHLIS SAMAAWAATE WAL ARAZEEN \n(of) the people of the heavens and the earths, \nوَمَنْ سَبَّحَ لَكَ يَا رَبَّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ مِنَ الْاَوَّلِيْنَ وَالْاٰخِرِيْنَ \nWA MAN SABBAHA LAKA YAA RABBAL A’ALAMEEN MENAL AWWALEENA WAL AAKHEREEN \nand (of) those who glorify You, (O the Lord of the worlds), from among the ancient and the present, \nعَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ عَبْدِكَ وَرَسُوْلِكَ وَنَبِيِّكَ وَاَمِيْنِكَ \nA’LAA MOHAMMADIN A’BDEKA WA RASOOLEKA WA NABIYYEKA WA AMEENEKA \nbe on Mohammad, Your servant and Apostle Your Prophet Your confidant, \nوَنَجِيِّكَ وَحَبِيْبِكَ وَصَفِيِّكَ وَصِفْوَتِكَ وَخَاصَّتِكَ \nWA NAJEEBEKA WA HABEEBEKA WA SAFIYYEKA WA SIFWATEKA WA KHAASSATEKA \nYour noble one, Your beloved, Your pure one, Your chosen one, Your special one,\nوَخَالِصَتِكَ وَخِيَرَتِكَ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ \nWA KHAALESATEKA WA KHEYARATEKA MIN KHALQEKA \nYour sincere one, and Your choice from among Your creation;\nوَاَعْطِهِ الْفَضْلَ وَالْفَضِيْلَةَ وَالْوَسِيْلَةَ وَالدَّرَجَةَ الرَّفِيْعَةَ \nWA AA’TEHIL FAZLA WAL FAZEELATA WAL WASEELATA WADDARAJATAR RAFEEA’TA\nand grant him the excellence, the merit, the means (al-Wasilah) and the lofty rank,\nوَابْعَثْهُ مَقَامًا مَّحْمُوْدًا يَّغْبِطُهٗ بِهِ الْاَوَّلُوْنَ وَالْاٰخِرُوْنَ \nWABA’SHO MAQAAMAM MAHMOODANY YAGHBETOHU BEHIL AWWALOONA WAL AAKHEROONA \nand raise him to a praiseworthy station for which the first and the last will envy him.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنَّكَ قُلْتَ وَلَوْ اَنَّهُمْ اِذْ ظَلَمُوْا اَنْفُسَهُمْ \nALLAAHUMMA INNAKA QULTA WA LAW ANNAHUM IZZALAMOO ANFOSAHUM \nO Allah. You said: “And if, when they had wronged themselves, they had \nجَآئُوْكَ فَاسْتَغْفَرُوْا اللهَ وَاسْتَغْفَرَ لَهُمُ الرَّسُوْلُ \nJAAAOOO-KA FASTAGHFARUL LAAHA WASTAGHFARA LAHOMUR RASOOLO \nbut come unto you and asked forgiveness of Allah, and asked forgiveness of the Apostle, \nلَوَجَدُوْا اللهَ تَوَّابًا رَّحِيْمًا \nLAWAJADUL LAAHA TAWWAABAR RAHEEMAN \nthey would have found Allah Forgiving, Merciful.” \nاِلٰهِیْ فَقَدْ اَتَيْتُ نَبِيَّكَ مُسْتَغْفِرًا \nELAAHI FAQAD ATAYTO NABIYYAKA MUSTAGHFERAN \nO my God, I have come to Your Prophet seeking forgiveness,\nتَآئِبًا مِنْ ذُنُوْبِیْ فَصَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَّاٰلِهٖ \nTAAEBAN MIN ZONOOBEE FASALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALEHI \nrepenting from my sins; so bless Muhammad and his family,\nوَاغْفِرْ هَالِیْ يَا سَيِّدَنَا اَتَوَجَّهُ بِكَ \nWAGH FIR HAALEE YAA SAYYEDANAA ATAWAJJAHO BEKA \nand forgive me. O our master, I turn through you\nوَبِاَهْلِ بَيْتِكَ اِلَی اللهِ تَعَالٰی رَبِّكَ وَرَبِّیْ لِيَغْفِرَ لِیْ\nWA BEAHLEBAYTEKA ELAL LAAHE TA-A’ALAA RABBEKA WA RABBEE LEYAGHFERA LEE\nand through your Household to Allah, the Exalted, your Lord and my Lord, that He may forgive me.\nSay 3 times:\nاِنَّا لِلّٰهِ وَاِنَّا اِلَيْهِ رَاجِعُوْنَ\nINNAA LILLAAHE WA INNAA ELAYHE RAAJEO’ON\nVerily we are Allah’s; and verily unto Him shall we return.\nاُصِبْنَا بِكَ يَا حَبِيْبَ قُلُوْبِنَا \nOSIBNAA BEKA YAA HABEEBA QOLOOBENAA \nWe have been afflicted with (the loss of) you, O beloved of our hearts!\nفَمَا اَعْظَمَ الْمُصِيْبَةَ بِكَ حَيْثُ انْقَطَعَ عَنَّا الْوَحْیُ \nFAMAAA A’ZAMAL MOSEEBATA BEKA HAYSUN QATA-A’ A’NNAL WAHYO \nHow great is the calamity of you, since the revelation has been cut off from us\nوَحَيْثُ فَقَدْ نَاكَ فَاِنَّا لِلّٰهِ وَاِنَّا اِلَيْهِ رَاجِعُوْنَ \nWA HAYSO FAQAD NAAKA FAINNAA LILLAAHE WA INNAA ELAYHE RAAJEO’ON \nand since we lost you! Verily we are Allah’s; and verily unto Him shall we return.\nيَا سَيِّدَنَا يَا رَسُوْلَ اللهِ صَلَوَاتُ اللهِ عَلَيْكَ \nYAA SAYYEDANAA YAA RASOOLAL LAAHE SALAWAATUL LAAHE A’LAYKA \nO our Chief! O our Apostle of Allah! Blessings of Allah be on you and on the pure \nوَعَلٰی اٰلِ بَيْتِكَ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ \nWA A’LAA AALEBAYTEKAT TAAHEREENA \nand pious people of your house. \nهٰذَا يَوْمُ السَّبْتِ وَهُوَ يَوْمُكَ \nHAAZAA YAWMUS SABTE WA HOWA YAWMOKA \nToday is Saturday, your day, \nوَاَنَا فِيْهِ ضَيْفُكَ وَجَارُكَ \nWA ANAA FEEHE ZAYFOKA WA JAAROKA \nand I am your guest and your neighbour on it;\nفَاَضِفْنِیْ وَاَجِرْنِیْ فَاِنَّكَ كَرِيْمٌ \nFA-AZIFNEE WA AJIRNEE FA-INNAKA KAREEMUN \nso receive me as your guest and grant me protection, for you are generous,\nتُحِبُّ الضِّيَافَةَ وَمَاْمُوْرٌ بِالْاِجَارَةِ \nTOHIBBUZ ZEYAAFATA WA MAAMOORUN BILEJAARATA \nyou love hospitality and are commanded to grant protection;\nفَاَضِفْنِیْ وَاَحْسِنْ ضِيَافَتِیْ \nFAAZIFNEE WA-AHSIN ZEYAAFATEE \nso receive me as your guest and host me well,\nوَاَجِرْنَا وَاَحْسِنْ اِجَارَتَنَا \nWA-AJIRNAA WA-AHSIN EJAARATANAA \nand protect us and grant us good protection,\nبِمَنْزِلَةِ اللهِ عِنْدَكَ وَعِنْدَ اٰلِ بَيْتِكَ \nBEMANZELATIL LAAHE I’NDAKA WA I’NDA AALEBAYTEKA \nby the status of Allah with you and with your Household,\nوَبِمَنْزِلَتِهِمْ عِنْدَهٗ وَبِمَا اسْتَوْدَعَكُمْ مِنْ عِلْمِهٖ \nWA BEMANZELATEHIM I’NDAHU WA BEMASTAWDA-A’KUM MIN I’LMEHI \nand by their status with Him, and by the knowledge of His that He has entrusted to you,\nفَاِنَّهٗ اَكْرَمُ الْاَكْرَمِيْنَ.\nFAINNAHU AKRAMUL AKRAMEEN.\nfor He is the Most Generous of the generous."
}
